{
  "_about": [
    "Hard input limits the API models enforce. Exceeding one is not a workflow",
    "defect the repair specialist can patch — a 3,000-character prompt has to be",
    "REWRITTEN and eight reference images have to be CHOSEN between, which is",
    "authoring, not repair. So a violation is handed back to the orchestrator",
    "instead (see src/utils/model_limits.py).",
    "",
    "Every number here is read off ComfyUI's own node code (comfy_api_nodes/",
    "nodes_*.py, validate_string / validate_prompts / get_number_of_images",
    "guards) as of ComfyUI 2026-08. They are the same checks that would raise at",
    "run time — the point of listing them is to catch it before a paid call.",
    "",
    "text:   input name -> maximum characters. fnmatch patterns allowed, so",
    "        'storyboard_*_prompt' covers all six storyboard slots.",
    "images: input name -> maximum images that may arrive on that input.",
    "A node not listed here has no known hard limit; unknown is not zero."
  ],

